  <front>
    <title>Advertising Seamless Bidirectional Forwarding Detection (S-BFD) Discriminators in the Layer Two Tunneling Protocol Version 3 (L2TPv3)</title>
    <seriesInfo name="RFC" value="7886" stream="IETF"/>
    <date year="2016" month="July"/>
    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This document defines a new Attribute-Value Pair (AVP) that allows
L2TP Control Connection Endpoints (LCCEs) to advertise one or more
Seamless Bidirectional Forwarding Detection (S-BFD) Discriminator
values using the Layer Two Tunneling Protocol version 3 (L2TPv3).</t>
    </abstract>
